# DexLadder — response headers (v155 stabilisation, 2026-09-07)
#
# Audit finding 20. A full policy already existed in site/_headers, but the file the deploy
# bundles actually carry was this one, which had no CSP, no HSTS and no Permissions-Policy.
# Both hosts were therefore serving the app with none of them.
#
# v162 · THE POLICY IS NOW ENFORCED. It shipped report-only from v155 so violations could be
# collected from real browsers first; report-only blocks nothing, so for that week the site had
# a policy it did not apply. The identical policy is now sent as Content-Security-Policy, with
# the report-only copy kept beside it so the console keeps naming violations. Verified before
# the flip: the built payload was served under this exact policy in headless Chromium, with
# network on and network off, and raised zero securitypolicyviolation events. No reporting
# endpoint is configured, deliberately — violations are read from the browser console, so no
# user request is sent to a third party.

/*
# v159b · LOOPBACK IS IN connect-src, and it has to be.
#   Two shipped features talk to a server the user runs on their own machine: the
#   Bring-Your-Own-Bot signal endpoint (lib/bots/signal.ts polls one URL per closed
#   bar) and the Local Fork sandbox (layers/43-fork.js sends JSON-RPC to Anvil or
#   Hardhat). Both are documented to use http://127.0.0.1 — signal.ts's own doctor
#   text tells the user to prefer it over localhost — and `connect-src 'self' https:`
#   blocked every one of those calls on the live site from v157 onward. Measured in
#   the browser on www.dexladder.com: a fetch to http://127.0.0.1 raised a
#   securitypolicyviolation with violatedDirective "connect-src".
#   WHAT THIS DOES NOT WIDEN: only loopback is added, and only for http/ws. No
#   public host gains anything. Loopback is reachable only by software already
#   running on the reader's own machine, and script-src here already carries
#   'unsafe-inline' — an attacker who can run script in this page does not need a
#   CSP hole to reach the reader's own localhost. The alternative was shipping two
#   features that cannot work.
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://s3.tradingview.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https: data: blob:; font-src 'self' https: data:; connect-src 'self' https: wss://fstream.binance.com http://127.0.0.1:* http://localhost:* http://[::1]:* ws://127.0.0.1:* ws://localhost:* ws://[::1]:*; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://s3.tradingview.com https://www.tradingview.com; media-src 'self' https: blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://s3.tradingview.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https: data: blob:; font-src 'self' https: data:; connect-src 'self' https: wss://fstream.binance.com http://127.0.0.1:* http://localhost:* http://[::1]:* ws://127.0.0.1:* ws://localhost:* ws://[::1]:*; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://s3.tradingview.com https://www.tradingview.com; media-src 'self' https: blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json

/robots.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/sitemap.xml
  Content-Type: application/xml; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/og.png
  Content-Type: image/png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/icon-512.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/icon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/icon-maskable.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/api/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
